 oversized primary suite easily accommodates a California king-size bedroom set with room to relax, while the spacious secondary bedrooms can comfortably fit queen-size furniture and a desk. Large windows fill the interior with natural light, creating a bright and welcoming atmosphere throughout. Recent improvements include remodeled upstairs and downstairs bathrooms with new toilets. Enjoy a fenced backyard, two-car garage, and convenient access to Yowell Ranch parks, community amenities, walking trails, shopping, dining, schools, major roadways, and Fort Cavazos. Homes with this much space and flexibility are hard to find-schedule your private showing today!\n\nLicense Number: 525615\n\nLicensed In: Texas", "channel_id": "UCmdryrgNmYM2DtJwQNq9P_w", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmdryrgNmYM2DtJwQNq9P_w", "duration": 278, "view_count": 14, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=giUg8ezDjOU", "categories": ["Travel & Events"], "tags": ["9013 Bowfield Drive", "Killeen TX homes for sale", "Killeen TX real estate", "NextHome Southern Skies", "agent Asad Shaikh"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "channel": "Asad Shaikh - Texas Realtor", "channel_follower_count": 15, "uploader": "Asad Shaikh - Texas Realtor", "uploader_id": "@asadshaikhtxrealtor", "uploader_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@asadshaikhtxrealtor", "upload_date": "20260719", "timestamp": 1784421989, "availability": "public", "webpage_url_basename": "watch", "webpage_url_domain": "youtube.com", "extractor": "youtube", "extractor_key": "Youtube", "playlist": "Asad Shaikh - Texas Realtor - Videos", "playlist_id": "UCmdryrgNmYM2DtJwQNq9P_w", "playlist_title": "Asad Shaikh - Texas Realtor - Videos", "playlist_uploader": "Asad Shaikh - Texas Realtor", "playlist_uploader